msgid "GLPI reads the members of your Bitwarden organization from the privileged accounts page, on request: email address, role, status, two-step login and accessible collections. Never an item, a password or a note."
msgstr "GLPI reads the members of your Bitwarden organization from the privileged accounts page, on request: email address, role, status, two-step login and accessible collections. Never an item, a password or a note."

