msgstr "How to prepare Bitwarden:"

msgid "ISO/IEC 27001, controls A.5.17 and A.8.2"
msgstr "ISO/IEC 27001, controls A.5.17 and A.8.2"

msgid "Import a CSV file with a header, one line per item or per member. A new import of the same source and the same kind replaces the previous one in the current entity."
msgstr "Import a CSV file with a header, one line per item or per member. A new import of the same source and the same kind replaces the previous one in the current entity."

msgid "Import the items and the members of the vault (or read the members from Bitwarden), then follow up the gaps: password not changed within the expected delay, access of a person who left, member unknown in GLPI, vault administrator without two-step login, server controller administrator account missing from the vault. Nothing is changed automatically. The gaps are also shown in the access review campaigns."
msgstr "Import the items and the members of the vault (or read the members from Bitwarden), then follow up the gaps: password not changed within the expected delay, access of a person who left, member unknown in GLPI, vault administrator without two-step login, server controller administrator account missing from the vault. Nothing is changed automatically. The gaps are also shown in the access review campaigns."

